# hecke-pin: the dictionary steps `IsHeckeT`, `IsDiamond`, `IsAfQuotient`, `IsAfAction` pin Diamond–Shurman's objects

Task hecke-pin (2026-11-17), report `docs/research/hecke-pin.md`, scratch `scratch/hecke-pin/`.

